---
title: "Register a taxon manually"
sidebar:
  order: 5
---

Add a taxonomic name to the project registry for specimen identification.

## Steps

{% steps %}

1. Open the project dashboard and locate `Taxon Registry`.
2. Select `Add taxon` and stay on the `Manual` mode.
3. Choose the `Taxon rank` this record represents, then fill in the name fields it shows.
4. Add authorship, vernacular name, conservation status, or notes when available.
5. Save and confirm that the taxon appears in the project registry.
{% /steps %}

{% aside type="tip" %}

Register a family or genus when material is not yet identified to species, then refine the record later.

{% /aside %}

